<v Jod Kaftan>Now the job could involve things like building a doghouse for my mastiff, Tim. Or I might walk up to you, and ask  you to take apart a radio and put it back together.

00:58:34.200 --> 00:58:42.370
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .

00:58:42.370 --> 00:58:56.050
<v Jod Kaftan>Marlon say you work for me now.

00:58:56.050 --> 00:59:01.050
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
